\title{AttributeCapabilityAnalyzer}
\description{
Attribute (Binomial / Poisson) process capability analyzer.
Inherits \code{IqrAnalyzerBase} and computes the standard Minitab-style
attribute capability outputs: rate estimate, CI, PPM/DPMO, Z.Bench /
sigma level, control chart for stability, and dispersion GOF test.

Two distributions are supported via \code{plan$analysis_type}:
\itemize{
\item \code{"binomial"} — for defectives / pass-fail data. Rate \code{p} = proportion
defective; PPM = p * 1e6; uses p-chart limits.
\item \code{"poisson"} — for defect counts. Rate \code{lambda} = defects per unit;
DPMO = lambda * 1e6; uses u-chart limits.
}
}
